#M. Olah, C. Bologa, and T. I. Oprea. An automated PLS search for biologically
#relevant QSAR descriptors. J. Comput. Aided Mol. Des., 18:437–449, 2004
#SMARTS pattern here in comparison with 2D molecular descriptors for QSAR
# SMARTS pattern: 38
#not daylight conform 0
